cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Verified logistic regression in Isabelle/HOL"
authors:
  - family-names: Bryant
    given-names: Dustin
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-17
repository-code: "https://github.com/brydustin/Verified_Logistic_Regression"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - Isabelle/HOL
  - formal verification
  - logistic regression
  - gradient descent
  - projected gradient descent
  - convex optimization
  - interactive theorem proving
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked formalization in Isabelle/HOL of L2-regularized logistic
  regression: closed-form gradient and Hessian of the loss, Hessian bounds
  giving smoothness and strong convexity, existence of the minimizer over any
  closed set, a linear convergence rate for gradient descent, and a bridge from
  Hessian bounds to the first-order certificates of the AFP entry
  Projected_Gradient_Descent, yielding hypothesis-free projected gradient
  descent rates over closed convex weight sets. Built on HOL-Higher_Diff with
  no sorry.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Projected Gradient Descent"
    authors:
      - family-names: Lyu
        given-names: Feier
    year: 2026
    collection-title: "Archive of Formal Proofs"
    url: "https://isa-afp.org/entries/Projected_Gradient_Descent.html"
